mas on a journey through his memories and uncover the truth behind this emotional, mysterious story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPORTANT: The story touches on themes related to violence, drugs, and weapons, although these topics are not explored in depth.</strong></p>",
